This skill combines and modifies two upstream projects.

  Japanese patterns derive from https://github.com/iKora128/stop-ai-slop-jp
  English patterns derive from https://github.com/hardikpandya/stop-slop

Both are spread across policies/ and examples/. SKILL.md, README.md, and the
split into per-policy files are original to this repository. Both upstreams are
MIT licensed; their notices follow.

The Japanese pattern classification and examples trace back to the note article
"その文章、AIに書かせただろ" by だいち (GENSHI AI):
https://note.com/ikora/n/n0bbb2828b91e

